          "short": "$TP = 4\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Tangent–secant product rule:\n$$\\begin{align*}TP^2 &= TA\\times TB\\\\TP^2 &= 8\\times2\\\\TP^2 &= 16\\\\TP &= 4\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
